@startuml ChatActivityStandard
!theme plain
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 20

title Chat Interaction Activity

start
:User is authenticated and logged in;
:User selects chat agent (sales, support, research);
:User types message in chat interface;

if (Message is not empty and within limits?) then (yes)
  :Click "Send" button;
  :Add message to local chat UI immediately;
  :Format request payload with message and metadata;
  :Send request to API Gateway;
  
  if (API Gateway validates JWT token?) then (yes)
    :Extract user context (roles, permissions);
    :Check rate limits in Redis;
    
    if (Rate limit not exceeded?) then (yes)
      :Forward request to Agent Service with context;
      :Agent Service initializes LangGraph agent;
      
      fork
        :Search Knowledge Base for relevant context;
        :Preprocess query text and clean input;
        :Generate query embedding vector;
        
        if (Cache hit in Redis?) then (yes)
          :Retrieve cached search results;
        else (no)
          :Perform vector similarity search in Qdrant;
          :Apply relevance scoring algorithm;
          :Cache results in Redis (TTL: 1 hour);
        endif
        
        :Format context with relevant documents;
        :Return context to Agent Service;
      fork again
        :Format prompt with context + user message;
        :Apply agent-specific instructions and tools;
        :Send request to LLM API (OpenAI/Anthropic/Ollama);
        
        if (LLM API responds successfully?) then (yes)
          :Receive AI response with metadata;
          :Extract any tool calls from response;
          
          if (Tool calls are present?) then (yes)
            :Execute tools (search, calculations, database queries);
            :Process tool results and incorporate into response;
          endif
          
        else (no)
          :Handle LLM API timeout or error;
          :Attempt retry (maximum 3 attempts);
          
          if (Retry succeeds?) then (yes)
            :Continue with successful response;
          else (no)
            :Return fallback response or error message;
          endif
        endif
      end fork
      
      :Log interaction to Dashboard Service for analytics;
      :Cache response in Redis (TTL: 30 minutes);
      :Return response with metadata to API Gateway;
      :API Gateway logs response metrics;
      :Return response to Frontend;
      :Update chat UI with new AI message;
      :Display context sources if available;
      :Show response metadata (model, response time);
      
    else (no)
      :API Gateway returns 429 Too Many Requests;
      :Frontend shows rate limit exceeded message;
      :Display countdown timer until next request;
      :Temporarily disable send button;
    endif
    
  else (no)
    :API Gateway returns 401 Unauthorized;
    :Frontend redirects to login page;
    :Clear expired tokens from localStorage;
  endif
  
else (no)
  :Show validation error (empty message, too long);
  :Highlight input field with error state;
  :User can correct and retry;
endif

if (User wants to rate response quality?) then (yes)
  :User clicks thumbs up or thumbs down;
  
  if (User clicked thumbs down?) then (yes)
    :Show optional feedback text area;
    :User can provide improvement suggestions;
    :Send rating + feedback to Dashboard Service;
  else (no)
    :Send simple rating to Dashboard Service;
  endif
  
  :Dashboard Service stores rating data;
  :Update agent performance metrics;
  :Calculate new quality scores;
  :Show "Thank you for feedback" message;
endif

if (User wants to continue conversation?) then (yes)
  :User types next message;
  :Process continues with same thread_id;
  :Maintain conversation context and history;
else (no)
  :Conversation session ends naturally;
  :Agent Service saves final conversation state;
  :Update conversation summary in database;
endif

if (Error occurred during processing?) then (yes)
  if (Knowledge Base service unavailable?) then (yes)
    :Agent Service continues without context;
    :Log knowledge base error for monitoring;
    :Return response with limited functionality;
    :Frontend shows "Knowledge base temporarily unavailable";
    
  elseif (LLM API rate limit exceeded?) then (yes)
    :Agent Service implements exponential backoff;
    :Queue request for retry when limit resets;
    :Return "Service temporarily busy" message;
    
  elseif (Database connection error?) then (yes)
    :Agent Service attempts database reconnection;
    
    if (Reconnection succeeds after retries?) then (yes)
      :Resume normal processing;
    else (no)
      :Return 503 Service Unavailable;
      :Frontend shows "Service temporarily unavailable";
    endif
    
  else (Other unexpected errors)
    :Agent Service logs detailed error information;
    :API Gateway returns 500 Internal Server Error;
    :Frontend shows generic error message;
    :Provide option to retry or contact support;
  endif
endif

stop

note right
  **Chat Features:**
  - Multi-agent support (sales, support, research agents)
  - RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) with vector search
  - Tool calling framework for external integrations
  - Real-time response caching for performance
  - Conversation history persistence
  - Response rating and feedback system
  - Rate limiting and abuse prevention
  - Comprehensive error handling and recovery
end note

@enduml
